        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;① CloudFront + WAF + ACM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;정적 자원 엣지 캐시, Response Headers Policy(HSTS·CSP·nosniff), HTTP→HTTPS. WAF: IP 평판·Common·KnownBadInputs + rate 전체 2,000/5분·예약 경로 100/5분(Count→Block), 로그 → CloudWatch Logs. ACM은 us-east-1, DNS 검증, 13개월 자동 갱신&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
