        <mxCell id="step-5" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="150" y="690" width="28" height="28" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="beh" value="CloudFront Behavior (주소로 분기)&lt;br&gt;1) /petclinic/resources/* → ALB · CachingOptimized 1일&lt;br&gt;2) /images/* → S3 mc-images(OAC) · 캐시 1일+&lt;br&gt;3) /petclinic/login/* · /oauth2/* → ALB · 캐시 없음 · 쿠키·쿼리 전달&lt;br&gt;4) 기본(/*) → ALB · CachingDisabled · AllViewer" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#8C4FFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="790" width="700" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-bg" value="" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.rect;fillColor2=none;strokeWidth=1;size=20;indent=5;fillColor=light-dark(#EDF3FF,#305363);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1640" y="30" width="600" height="900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-container" value="" style="group" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1660" y="54" width="560" height="860" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-title" value="진입 계층 · 흐름과 설정" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry width="540" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-1" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="34" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-1" value="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-1" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;사용자 → Route 53&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;hospital.example.com A/AAAA 별칭 → CloudFront. Route 53 Failover 없음(단일 리전). 리전 DR 시 로드맵&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-2" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="134" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-2" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront + WAF + ACM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;정적은 엣지 캐시, 동적은 캐시 없이 통과. WAF는 관리형 3(IP 평판·Common·KnownBadInputs)+rate 2, Count→Block. 로그 → CloudWatch Logs. ACM은 us-east-1, 자동 갱신&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-3" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="234" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-3" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront → ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Origin HTTPS only(ALB 443 + 서울 ACM), X-Origin-Verify 헤더로 우회 차단, SG는 CloudFront 접두사 목록만. 보안 헤더는 Response Headers Policy(HSTS·CSP·nosniff)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-4" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="334" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-4" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-4" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront → S3 (OAC)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;/images/*는 mc-images 버킷을 직접 읽어 서버 미경유. 오리진 5xx면 점검 페이지 버킷. 둘 다 OAC(SigV4) + 버킷 정책 SourceArn 조건, 공개 읽기 없음. 환자 개인 이미지는 캐시 안 함(Presigned URL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-5" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="434" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-5" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-5" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;로그인 (Cognito = IdP)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;앱(Spring Security OAuth2 Client)이 Cognito Hosted UI로 보내고 콜백 /petclinic/login/oauth2/code/cognito 로 복귀. cognito:groups → ROLE 매핑은 WAS 계층에서&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" value="&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;이 탭의 로그: WAF 로그(CloudWatch Logs, 30일). ACM DaysToExpiry 알람은 운영 탭 CloudWatch에서.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="538" width="556" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
