          <mxGeometry x="2100" y="54" width="560" height="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-title" value="WEB 계층 · 흐름과 설정" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry width="540" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-1" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="34" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-1" value="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-1" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront → IGW → Public ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;ALB 443 리스너 + 서울 ACM. 리스너 규칙: X-Origin-Verify 불일치 403. SG는 CloudFront 관리형 접두사 목록만&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-2" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="134" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-2" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;헬스체크 (얕게)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;tg-web 경로 /health.html(정적, Apache 생존만) 10s·5s·정상 2/비정상 3, 등록 취소 30s. WAS 장애는 Internal ALB·RDS 알람이 잡음(연쇄 unhealthy 방지)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-3" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="234" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-3" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auto Scaling — WEB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;CPU 60% 대상 추적, min 2·max 6, 두 AZ 균등, 워밍업 180s, 헬스체크 유형 ELB. 골든 AMI(AL2023·Apache MPM event·CloudWatch Agent) 기동&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-4" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="334" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-4" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-4" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Apache → Internal ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;ProxyPass /petclinic/ → 내부 ALB DNS:8080, ProxyPreserveHost On(Host·X-Forwarded-For 유지). 정적 /resources는 Apache가 직접 서빙(캐시 미스 시)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-5" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="434" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-5" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-5" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;로그&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;CloudWatch Agent → /mc/web/access·error 30일(EC2 종료돼도 남음). ALB 액세스 로그 → S3 mc-logs 90일(p95·5XX 대상별). 헬스체크 요청은 access log 제외&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-6" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="534" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-6" value="6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-6">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-6" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;운영자 접속 (SSM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Bastion·22번 없음. 인스턴스 프로파일 AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore, 아웃바운드 443은 NAT. 세션 로그 → CloudWatch Logs /mc/ssm 90일&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-6">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" value="&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;NAT Gateway는 아웃바운드 전용(dnf·Agent·SSM). SSM은 사람이 들어가는 길, NAT는 서버가 나가는 길 — 둘 다 필요.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="638" width="556" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
