        <mxCell id="lg-d-1" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Internal ALB (깊게)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;tg-was 헬스체크 /petclinic/(슬래시 필수, permitAll이라 로그인 리다이렉트 없음) 10s·2/3, 등록 취소 30s. 로그인 세션 때문에 stickiness(AWSALB 쿠키 1일) 켬 — Apache는 쿠키 그대로 전달&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-2" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="134" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-2" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tomcat 튜닝&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;maxThreads·acceptCount 상향, connectionTimeout 단축, JVM -Xms=-Xmx. 커넥션 풀 크기 = maxThreads와 DB 상한 사이. RemoteIpValve로 HTTPS 콜백 URL 생성&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-3" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="234" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-3" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;WAS → RDS Proxy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;JDBC sslMode=REQUIRED, 풀 validationQuery. 8대로 늘어도 Proxy가 DB 연결 상한을 지킴(④ 탭)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-4" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="334" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-4" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-4" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;로그인 · 예약 이벤트&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Spring Security OAuth2 Client: Cognito에서 code 받아 토큰 교환(NAT 경유), cognito:groups → ROLE_VET/ADMIN, CSRF는 form:form 자동. 고객이 예약을 등록하면 구조화 로그 1줄(RESERVATION_CREATED vet·time) → CloudWatch Logs → ⑤ 탭에서 Slack 알림&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-5" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="434" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-5" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-5" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;로그&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Agent → /mc/was catalina·access·gc 30일 + 로그인 성공/실패 이벤트 /mc/was/auth. 종료 수명 주기 훅(300s)으로 마지막 로그·덤프를 S3 mc-logs/was에 sync 후 종료&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-6" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
