        <mxCell id="lg-b-1" value="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-1" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;로그 수집 (필수 5)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;① WAF 로그 ② WEB Agent ③ WAS Agent ④ ALB 액세스(S3) ⑤ SSM 세션. VPC Flow Logs·RDS 로그는 제외(필요 시 로드맵). 로그는 항상 인스턴스 밖에&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-2" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="134" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-2" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudWatch 지표 · 알람&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;ALB RequestCount·TargetResponseTime p95·5XX·HealthyHost, ASG 인스턴스 수, RDS CPU·DatabaseConnections, ACM DaysToExpiry. 알람 3개 + 대상 추적 알람&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-2">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-3" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="234" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-3" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Grafana 대시보드&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Amazon Managed Grafana(Identity Center 로그인, 편집자 $9/월). CloudWatch 데이터소스. 행: 진입 → ALB → EC2 → RDS. Phase 3 전/후 비교는 Time shift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-3">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-4" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="334" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-4" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-4" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;알람 → Slack (2경로)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;AWS 자체 알람: CloudWatch → SNS mc-alerts → AWS Chatbot → #mc-alerts(코드 없음). 대시보드 지표 알림: Grafana Alerting → Slack webhook 직접. 6일차 WAS 1대 중지로 수신 테스트&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-4">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-5" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="434" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-5" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-5" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Slack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;webhook URL은 Grafana Contact point에만(저장소에 남기지 않음). Chatbot은 Slack 워크스페이스 인증 후 채널에 SNS 구독&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-5">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-6" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="534" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-6" value="6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-6">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-6" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;알람 → Auto Scaling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;WAS ASG 대상 추적(대상당 요청 수·CPU)이 CloudWatch 알람으로 동작. 예약 증설과 병행&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-6">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-7" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="634" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-7" value="7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-7">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-7" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;감사&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;CloudTrail 관리 이벤트 90일 무료 + 추적으로 S3 1년 보관, S3 데이터 이벤트로 의료 파일 열람 기록&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-7">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-8" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="734" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-8" value="8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-8">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-8" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;운영자 접속&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;SSM Session Manager(IAM·MFA) → 세션 로그 CloudWatch Logs. Run Command로 다수 인스턴스 설정 배포, Patch Manager로 롤링 패치&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-8">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-9" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="834" width="556" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-b-9" value="9" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="lg-9">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="38" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg-d-9" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;예약 알림 (업무 이벤트)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;고객 예약 등록 → WAS 로그 1줄(RESERVATION_CREATED vet·time·id) → CloudWatch Logs 구독 필터 → Lambda(20줄) → Slack #mc-reservations(수의사·시간·링크). 수의사가 링크 클릭 → Cognito OIDC 로그인 → 예약 화면. 같은 로그의 지표 필터로 예약 건수 대시보드·폭주 알람&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-9">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" value="&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Systems Manager 하나로 접속·명령·패치 처리, Bastion 없음. 예약 알림은 시스템 알람(SNS→Chatbot)과 채널을 분리(#mc-alerts / #mc-reservations).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="938" width="556" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
